+// The bisection gate. IsSceneReferred() stays the master - nothing runs without it - and this
+// narrows the request to the stage items at or below r_SceneReferredStage, so that a bad frame
+// (or a crash) can be walked back to one item from the console instead of from a rebuild.
+//
+// Deliberately a plain AND of the master and the stage number, evaluated at the same sites the
+// master is already read, so at the default (99) every call is exactly IsSceneReferred() and the
+// stock path is untouched either way.
+bool CRendererResources::IsSceneReferredStage(int nStage)
+{
+	return IsSceneReferred() && CRenderer::CV_r_SceneReferredStage >= nStage;
+}
